9. Write unit tests for `useDebouncedValue` verifying that the returned value updates only after the specified delay and does not update on every intermediate change.

10. Write an integration test that mounts the editor with `LivePreview`, simulates typing in the editor, and asserts the preview pane reflects the updated content after the debounce window.

